    <string name="title_about_weatherapp">About WeatherAPP</string>
    <string name="subtitle_about_weatherapp">Privacy-First Multi-Model Weather &amp; Solar Intelligence</string>
    <string name="about_section1_title">Application Scope &amp; Meteorological Foundation</string>
    <string name="about_section1_desc">WeatherAPP is a high-precision, privacy-first weather and astronomical platform designed for meteorology enthusiasts, outdoor planners, and night-sky observers. By integrating global numerical weather models (Environment Canada GEM, NOAA GFS, ECMWF, and CMA-GFS), WeatherAPP delivers multi-model forecast comparisons alongside real-time severe weather alert monitoring.</string>
    <string name="about_section2_title">Zero-GPS Privacy &amp; Persistent Caching</string>
    <string name="about_section2_desc">Unlike conventional weather applications that track your device movements in the background, WeatherAPP requires zero GPS permissions. All location calculations and weather data requests are anchored to explicit city selections. Forecast data is cached locally on your device with configurable Time-To-Live (TTL) durations to minimize API network usage and ensure offline availability.</string>
    <string name="about_section3_title">Solar Intelligence &amp; Generative AI Analysis</string>
    <string name="about_section3_desc">Beyond standard temperature and precipitation metrics, WeatherAPP delivers detailed solar lighting phases (Golden Hour, Blue Hour, Civil/Nautical/Astronomical Twilight), True Dark Sky window calculations, night visibility estimates, and Solunar activity periods. Weather summaries and atmospheric trends are optionally enriched using on-device or cloud generative AI models.</string>
    <string name="about_section4_title">100% Ad-Free, User-Supported &amp; Privacy Guarantee</string>
    <string name="about_section4_desc">WeatherAPP is proudly 100% ad-free. We firmly believe that weather forecasts and severe safety warnings should never be monetized through invasive banner ads, user tracking, or data brokering. WeatherAPP is sustained through voluntary user contributions and open-source community support.</string>
    <string name="about_section5_title">AI Transparency &amp; Development Notice</string>
    <string name="about_section5_desc">In the interest of full transparency with our users, Generative AI tools were utilized during the development, architecture design, and code optimization of WeatherAPP. All core meteorological algorithms, astronomical calculations, and alert processing pipelines have been thoroughly validated for accuracy.</string>

